<title>JAPAN: Japan private demand is rising - EPA.</title>
<headline>Japan private demand is rising - EPA.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Economic Planning Agency (EPA) Minister Taro Aso said on Friday that private demand was rising in Japan.</p>
<p>&quot;The Japanese economy is gradually recovering and private demand is firming up,&quot; Aso told the budget committee of parliament's Upper House.</p>
<p>Production is increasing, while capital spending and housing construction are on an upward trend, he added.</p>
